DISTRIBUTION SHAPE: ADAPTER-ONLY PUBLIC DEMO

Operator decision, 2026-09-30. Placement Gate is published as an
adapter-only demonstration. It binds at runtime to an operator-provided copy of
the upstream `ollama_controller` package and reproduces none of it.

Placement Gate redistributes NONE of the following:

  * ollama_controller, in whole or in part
  * the Model Characteristics Registry
  * any model weights, blobs, or GGUF files
  * any ledger, corpus, or machine-specific state
  * any other internal payload

Self-contained bundling is PROHIBITED until upstream licensing is explicitly
settled by the operator.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

UPSTREAM RIGHTS ARE NOT CONVEYED

This license conveys rights to Placement Gate's own code only. It grants no
rights in the upstream `ollama_controller` package, and a recipient of this
repository acquires no right to use, copy, or redistribute it by virtue of
receiving this one.

Upstream ownership and licensing are UNRESOLVED. As of 2026-09-30 the
`ollama_controller` package is not published on PyPI and its source tree carries
no license file. Placement Gate imports it at runtime; it does not vendor,
copy, or modify it.

Because nothing upstream is redistributed here, publication requires no grant
from anyone. But absent a license that code is all-rights-reserved by default,
so this repository has no durable right to depend on it -- it simply copies
nothing out.

No license was added to any upstream repository as part of this decision, and
none should be inferred from this repository's presence.

See docs/LICENSING.md for the full analysis and the remaining open question.

